# SPICT-4ALL FI governance
- Treat `AGENTS.md` as authoritative project instructions.
- Never modify `sources/official/**`.
- Never fabricate clinical facts, source wording, approvals, citations, test results, or reviewer decisions.
- Final wording is not approved until the human review gate is recorded.
- Do not describe automated checks as clinical validation.
- Preserve an auditable history of every candidate and decision.
- If evidence is missing, mark it missing; do not infer it.
